#: ../../source/reference/uiloader.rst:13
msgid ""
"The UiLoader class is tasked with loading user interface (UI) data from a"
" buffer (likely an XML or similar format), managing the UI document, "
"applying styles to the UI elements, and maintaining a hierarchy of "
"widgets. This class appears to be part of a larger UI framework that "
"supports widget-based layouts."
msgstr ""

